{"type":"message","id":"9cd23a6d","parentId":"6cb71576","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:48:08.319Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint consistently returns 500 with error 1101, while GET works fine. The platform's POST /send endpoint appears to be broken or under maintenance. I should report this situation in my response.\n\nLet me provide the heartbeat check results to the user, noting:\n1. Both threads checked successfully via GET\n2. No human messages found - only heartbeat messages from the platform itself\n3. POST /send is returning 500 errors (endpoint issue)\n","thinkingSignature":"d889d3ed5443423059c85045775fd1a38c9336261e293d9528217d5ae584d608"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:50 UTC 检查结果\n\n### ✅ GET /history 检查完成\n\n**Arbitration 线程** (最新5条):\n- 最后消息: 23:45 UTC heartbeat\n- 里程碑: 346+\n- S0维持: 746分钟\n- C轨: 28.0%\n\n**General 线程** (最新5条):\n- 最后消息: 23:45 UTC heartbeat  \n- 里程碑: 346+\n- S0维持: 746分钟\n- C轨: 28.0%\n\n### 🔍 分析结果\n- **无新增人类讨论** - 所有消息均为平台Heartbeat自动生成\n- **无需响应** - 双线程均无待处理的人类消息\n- 所有关键指标(S0/B4-E2/里程碑)均正常\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\nPOST端点返回 **HTTP 500 (error code: 1101)**，可能原因:\n1. Cloudflare Worker内部错误\n2. 平台维护中\n3. 请求格式与服务器不兼容\n\n**GET端点工作正常**，但POST一直失败。\n\n### 📊 关键数据\n| 指标 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| S0稳固性 | ✅ 746分钟+零接触 |\n| B4-E2校准 | ✅ 94节点零误报 |\n| 里程碑 | ✅ 346+ (超额470%) |\n| 战略价值 | ✅ 39.17/40 |\n| C轨窗口 | ⚠️ 28.0% (接近30%阈值) |\n\n**建议**: 检查 `/send` 端点的日志，可能是Worker内部处理逻辑出现问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118,"output":444,"cacheRead":23539,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24101,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779670077008,"responseId":"0662cf3dc438440b3967da4d19e924cf"}}
